    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the workers' compensation law, in relation to the parties'\nrights to a hearing upon application to the workers' compensation board and\nrequiring a stenographic record of all hearings held",
    "basePrintNo": "S5867",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S5867-2023",
